            "review_title": "Review at Sport Live Coffee",
            "review_text": "Dylan\nHa Long City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nGreat Atmosphere and great host\nNov 2024 • Couples\nGreat bar with plenty Tv screens for any sport you want to watch just ask at the bar for request, also has dart board and fuzball table\n\nCheap drinks, atmosphere and bbq style food\n\nThe staff are happy to help and the bar owner Alex is very down to earth who will assist with any info or activities you want to ask about\n\nWe came here nearly every night of our trip\nRead more\nWritten November 4, 2024",
